<title>TUNISIA: Syria's Khaddam meets Tunisian president.</title>
<headline>Syria's Khaddam meets Tunisian president.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Syrian Vice-President Abdel-Halim Khaddam discussed the Middle East peace process with Tunisian President Zine al-Abidine Ben Ali, the official Tunisian news agency TAP repoted.</p>
<p>It said Khaddam, who arrived in Tunis on Sunday, handed Ben Ali a message from President Hafez al-Assad on Arab issues and the Middle East peace process.</p>
